{#- The motto and the sign-up as one band of water on the Join page (Tine's choice, file 48, variant 1;
    reworked after reviewer feedback, October 2026: J8, J9, J10).
    The band opens with the group by the canal in Ghent; under their feet the canal runs on as water, through one long
    slow wave, into the motto, in English only (Tine, file 65: the language of this site, no switch). One seam deeper
    lies the sign-up: a big centred call, like the call at the bottom of the other pages.
    Texts for the sign-up come from "signup" in src/join.md; paste the Microsoft Forms link in src/_data/site.json under
    "joinFormUrl" to switch from the mail button to the form.
    Styles: "The motto as a band of water" in site.css. -#}
<section class="motto-band" aria-labelledby="sign-up-title">
  <figure class="band-motto">
    <div class="band-photo">
      {% photo "ghent-2022-canal-cheering", T.bandPhotoAlt, { sizes: "100vw" } %}
      <svg class="band-melt" viewBox="0 0 1440 120" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path class="band-melt-glint" d="M0,46 C110,46 170,14 290,14 C430,14 500,46 640,46 C790,46 860,24 1010,24 C1170,24 1250,38 1440,38 L1440,120 L0,120 Z"></path>
        <path class="band-melt-water" d="M0,86 C120,86 190,46 320,46 C470,46 540,80 690,80 C850,80 920,58 1080,58 C1240,58 1320,70 1440,70 L1440,120 L0,120 Z"></path>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="band-water on-dark">
      <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="band-quote">
          <p class="band-line" lang="{{ L }}">{{ T.bandMotto | safe }}</p>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </figure>

  <svg class="band-seam" viewBox="0 0 1440 72" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <path d="M0,14 C96,14 144,49 240,49 C384,49 456,24.5 600,24.5 C764,24.5 846,44.2 1010,44.2 C1182,44.2 1268,35 1440,35 L1440,72 L0,72 Z"></path>
  </svg>
  {#- Links from other pages (the review page) jump here (#sign-up) -#}
  <div class="band-deep on-dark" id="sign-up">
    <div class="container band-signup">
      <h2 id="sign-up-title">{{ signup.title }}</h2>
      {% if site.joinFormUrl %}
      <p>{{ signup.text }}</p>
      {% if signup.promises %}<ul class="chips chips-on-dark" aria-label="{{ T.signingUpMeans }}">{% for p in signup.promises %}<li>{{ p }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
      {# A link, not an embedded frame: an embedded Microsoft form would load Microsoft content (and cookies) on every visit to this page. #}
      <a class="btn btn-tint-lime" href="{{ site.joinFormUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-goatcounter-click="join-form-button" data-goatcounter-title="Open the sign-up form" data-goatcounter-referrer="{{ page.url }}">{{ signup.button }}</a>
      <p class="form-note">{{ T.opensInTab }}</p>
      {% else %}
      <p>{{ signup.waiting }}</p>
      {# No form yet (Raphaël adds it later): a mail button instead. #}
      <a class="btn btn-tint-lime" href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}?subject={{ T.mailSubject }}" data-goatcounter-click="join-mail-button" data-goatcounter-title="Email us (mail button)" data-goatcounter-referrer="{{ page.url }}">{{ signup.waitingButton }}</a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <svg class="band-edge" viewBox="0 0 1440 64" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <path d="M0,23 C80,23 120,44 200,44 C304,44 356,26 460,26 C580,26 640,40 760,40 C892,40 958,29.5 1090,29.5 C1230,29.5 1300,37 1440,37 L1440,0 L0,0 Z"></path>
  </svg>
</section>
